### info-fresh
$ wallpaper ["info"]
Wallpaper Information
---------------------
Current:    (none)
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-1)
-----------------------------
Current:    (none)
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
### set-all
$ wallpaper ["set" "@DIR@/a.png"]
Wallpaper set to @DIR@/a.png
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-1)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/a.png
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-2"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-2)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/a.png
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
### set-monitor-fit
$ wallpaper ["set" "@DIR@/b.png" "--fit" "center" "--monitor" "DP-2"]
Wallpaper set to @DIR@/b.png on DP-2
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-2"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-2)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/b.png
Fit Mode:   center
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-1)
-----------------------------
Current:    (none)
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info"]
Wallpaper Information
---------------------
Current:    (none)
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
### set-tile
$ wallpaper ["set" "@DIR@/a.png" "-f" "tile"]
[stderr] Error: Failed to set fit mode: Invalid fit mode: tile
[exit 1]
### set-missing
$ wallpaper ["set" "/nonexistent/x.png"]
[stderr] Error: Failed to set wallpaper: image not found: /nonexistent/x.png
[exit 1]
$ wallpaper ["set" "/nonexistent/x.png" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
[stderr] Error: Failed to set wallpaper: image not found: /nonexistent/x.png
[exit 1]
### cycle
$ wallpaper ["cycle" "@DIR@"]
Started cycling wallpapers from @DIR@ every 300 seconds
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-1)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/a.png
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    active
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["next"]
Advanced to next wallpaper
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-2"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-2)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/b.png
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    active
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["previous"]
Went back to previous wallpaper
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info" "--monitor" "DP-1"]
Wallpaper Information (DP-1)
-----------------------------
Current:    @DIR@/a.png
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    active
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["stop"]
Wallpaper cycling stopped
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["info"]
Wallpaper Information
---------------------
Current:    (none)
Fit Mode:   fill
Cycling:    inactive
[stderr] [exit 0]
### cycle-flags
$ wallpaper ["cycle" "@DIR@" "-i" "60" "-m" "shuffle"]
Started cycling wallpapers from @DIR@ every 60 seconds
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["cycle" "@DIR@" "--interval=5" "--mode=sequential"]
Started cycling wallpapers from @DIR@ every 5 seconds
[stderr] [exit 0]
### cycle-missing
$ wallpaper ["cycle" "/nonexistent/dir"]
[stderr] Error: Failed to start cycling: directory not found: /nonexistent/dir
[exit 1]
### cycle-empty
$ wallpaper ["cycle" "@EMPTY@"]
[stderr] Error: Failed to start cycling: no images found in directory: @EMPTY@
[exit 1]
### next-without-cycle
$ wallpaper ["next"]
Advanced to next wallpaper
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["previous"]
Went back to previous wallpaper
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["stop"]
Wallpaper cycling stopped
[stderr] [exit 0]
### theming
$ wallpaper ["theming-monitor" "DP-1"]
Theming monitor: DP-1
[stderr] [exit 0]
$ wallpaper ["theming-monitor" ""]
Theming monitor: default
[stderr] [exit 0]
### not-running
$ wallpaper ["info"]
[stderr] Error: Wallpaper service not running. Start wayle shell first.
[exit 1]
$ wallpaper ["stop"]
[stderr] Error: Wallpaper service not running. Start wayle shell first.
[exit 1]
$ wallpaper ["set" "@DIR@/a.png"]
[stderr] Error: Wallpaper service not running. Start wayle shell first.
[exit 1]
